# Low-left spin-induced throw and spin-transfer diagnostic.
# Cue and 1 start on one vertical line, perpendicular to the top cushion.
# Expected: the 1 heads mostly toward the top cushion with a small leftward cut and transferred right spin.
ball cue at (2.0, 3.0)
ball one at (2.0, 4.0)
cue_strike(default).mass_ratio(1.0).energy_loss(0.1)
trace(max_events: 8)
shot(cue).heading(0deg).speed(medium-soft).tip(side: -0.35R, height: -0.35R).using(default)
